{"unit_id":"Kylanfang__ArchiLens#feature-1","repo":"Kylanfang/ArchiLens","commit":"125a1fff7870aa540ed0a378448b244df50413ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArchiLens 的功能「RTL 拓扑扫描与派生」：扫描 Verilog/SystemVerilog 文件并抽取模块、接口与实例证据，再从证据包机械生成拓扑规格；通过 scan 和 derive 子命令触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["hw-topo/lib/scan-rtl.mjs:1-10","hw-topo/lib/spec.mjs:1-5"]}
{"unit_id":"Kylanfang__ArchiLens#feature-2","repo":"Kylanfang/ArchiLens","commit":"125a1fff7870aa540ed0a378448b244df50413ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArchiLens 的功能「证据复核」：verify 会重新扫描 RTL 树并逐个检查规格元素是否有匹配的文件、行号和内容；用户提供规格与 RTL 根目录后获得逐元素判定及验证结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["hw-topo/lib/verify.mjs:1-13","hw-topo/lib/verify.mjs:42-48"]}
{"unit_id":"Kylanfang__ArchiLens#feature-3","repo":"Kylanfang/ArchiLens","commit":"125a1fff7870aa540ed0a378448b244df50413ac","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"ArchiLens 的功能「图示交付」：deliver 根据拓扑规格生成交互式 HTML、SVG 图、代码库 wiki 索引和 JSON 回执；用户传入规格及输出前缀即可取得这些文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["hw-topo/bin/hw-topo.mjs:10","hw-topo/lib/wiki.mjs:35-40","hw-topo/lib/render-svg.mjs:1"]}
